# Only public/ is ever served (vercel.json -> outputDirectory). Excluding
# everything else from the upload as well is defence in depth: even if the
# output directory were ever misconfigured to the repo root, none of these
# files would exist on the deployment to be served.
#
# Nothing here is needed to build the site -- there is no build step at all,
# just static HTML that the fetch scripts have already written data into.
.env
.env.*
*.py
__pycache__/
requirements.txt
docs/
*_output.json
journal_*.json
.github/
.vscode/
README.md
